{"id":"75f2cfac579d78b3","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-normal-function.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal2 Normal Function","display":"df-zfc-ordinal2-normal-function — ZFC Ordinal2 Normal Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-normal-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal2-normal-function","58-df-zfc-ordinal8-normal-function"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal2-normal-function — ZFC Ordinal2 Normal Function","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-normal-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal2-normal-function</span><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal8-normal-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal2-normal-function — ZFC Ordinal2 Normal Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,\\theta\\in V\">\\(f,\\theta\\in V\\)</span> (function and ordinal domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (limit ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2NormalFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2NormalFunction}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}normal\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2NormalFunction}_S(f,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\n\\exists\\gamma\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\theta,\\gamma))\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\theta\\;(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)\\in f(\\beta))\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to f(\\lambda)=\\bigcup\\{f(\\alpha):\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\}\\bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}normal\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2NormalFunction}_S(f,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\n\\exists\\gamma\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\theta,\\gamma))\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\theta\\;(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)\\in f(\\beta))\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to f(\\lambda)=\\bigcup\\{f(\\alpha):\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\}\\bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Continuity at limits is expressed by the union of the set of earlier ordinal values, avoiding an undeclared supremum operator.</li>\n<li>The ordinal8 normal-function variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S$ (limit ordinal predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2NormalFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}normal\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2NormalFunction}_S(f,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\n\\exists\\gamma\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\theta,\\gamma))\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\theta\\;(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)\\in f(\\beta))\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to f(\\lambda)=\\bigcup\\{f(\\alpha):\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\}\\bigr)\n\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1558,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2994","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-normal-function.md|58-df-zfc-ordinal2-normal-function]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2","81cabbac7fa4d75d"]}